#: includes/class-admin.php:624
msgid ""
"A Google framework for privacy-safe tag behavior. Before consent, storage "
"signals are denied; after user choice, signals are updated (for example "
"analytics_storage=granted). This helps GTM/Google tags respect user consent "
"state."
msgstr ""
"Et Google-framework for privatlivssikret tagadfærd. Før samtykke afvises "
"lagringssignaler; efter brugerens valg opdateres signalerne (for eksempel "
"analytics_storage=granted). Det hjælper GTM/Google-tags med at respektere "
"brugerens samtykkestatus."

