#: includes/class-admin.php:799
msgid ""
"Script blocking prevents third-party scripts from running until the visitor "
"gives consent for that category. WordPress-enqueued scripts with known "
"handles (Google Analytics, Meta Pixel, etc.) are auto-blocked."
msgstr ""
"Scriptblokering forhindrer tredjepartsscripts i at køre, indtil den "
"besøgende giver samtykke til den pågældende kategori. Scripts, der er sat i "
"kø i WordPress med kendte handles (Google Analytics, Meta Pixel osv.), "
"blokeres automatisk."

#: includes/class-script-blocker.php:283
