#: includes/class-admin.php:296
msgid "The AI will return improved JSON with clear cookie descriptions."
msgstr "AI-værktøjet returnerer forbedret JSON med tydelige cookiebeskrivelser."

#: includes/class-admin.php:554
msgid ""
"The Container ID is your Google Tag Manager workspace identifier (format: "
"GTM-XXXXXXX), found in GTM top bar or Admin. In this plugin it is a "
"reference field to keep configuration documented; it does not automatically "
"embed the GTM code snippet."
msgstr ""
"Container-ID'et er din Google Tag Manager-identifikator for arbejdsområdet "
"(format: GTM-XXXXXXX), som findes i GTM's topbjælke eller "
"administrationsområde. I dette plugin er det et referencefelt til "
"dokumentation af konfigurationen; det indlejrer ikke automatisk "
"GTM-kodestykket."

#: kansleri-cookie-consent.php:407
msgid ""
"The plugin also records anonymous, aggregated consent statistics (how many "
"visitors accepted, rejected, or customized cookies each day) and individual "
"consent log entries for GDPR audit compliance. Consent log entries contain a"
" hashed (non-reversible) visitor identifier, the consent choice, which "
"categories were accepted, and the policy version. No IP addresses, user "
"identifiers, or personal data are stored in plain text. Consent log records "
"are automatically deleted after 13 months."
msgstr ""
"Pluginet registrerer også anonyme, aggregerede samtykkestatistikker (hvor "
"mange besøgende der accepterede, afviste eller tilpassede cookies hver dag) "
"samt individuelle poster i samtykkeloggen til GDPR-revision. Poster i "
"samtykkeloggen indeholder en hashbaseret (ikke-reversibel) "
"besøgsidentifikator, det valgte samtykke, de accepterede kategorier og "
"politikversionen. IP-adresser, "
"brugeridentifikatorer eller personoplysninger gemmes ikke i klartekst. "
"Poster i samtykkeloggen slettes automatisk efter 13 måneder."

#: includes/class-admin.php:778
msgid "The plugin re-checks cookies every day via cron."
msgstr "Pluginet kontrollerer cookies igen hver dag via cron."

#: includes/class-admin.php:207 includes/class-admin.php:407
msgid "Theme style (inherit site typography)"
msgstr "Temastil (følger webstedets typografi)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:603
msgid ""
"Theme style inherits site typography. Plugin style uses strict sizes/colors "
"for consistent readability."
msgstr ""
"Temastil følger webstedets typografi. Pluginstil bruger faste "
"skriftstørrelser og farver for ensartet læsbarhed."

#: includes/class-policy-page.php:61
msgid ""
"These cookies allow the website to remember choices you make and provide "
"enhanced functionality and personalisation."
msgstr ""
"Disse cookies gør det muligt for webstedet at huske de valg, du foretager, "
"og giver forbedret funktionalitet og personalisering."

#: includes/class-policy-page.php:58
msgid ""
"These cookies are essential for the website to function and cannot be "
"switched off."
msgstr ""
"Disse cookies er essentielle for, at webstedet kan fungere, og kan ikke slås"
" fra."

#: includes/class-policy-page.php:60
msgid ""
"These cookies are used to deliver relevant advertisements and track ad "
"campaign performance."
msgstr ""
"Disse cookies bruges til at vise relevante annoncer og spore ydeevnen af "
"annoncekampagner."

#: includes/class-policy-page.php:59
msgid ""
"These cookies help us understand how visitors interact with the website by "
"collecting and reporting information anonymously."
msgstr ""
"Disse cookies hjælper os med at forstå, hvordan besøgende interagerer med "
"webstedet, ved at indsamle og rapportere oplysninger anonymt."

#: includes/class-admin.php:804
msgid ""
"These script handles are automatically recognized and blocked before "
"consent. No configuration needed — they are blocked by default when detected"
" on your site."
msgstr ""
"Disse script-handles genkendes og blokeres automatisk før samtykke. Ingen "
"konfiguration er nødvendig — de blokeres som standard, når de registreres på"
" dit websted."

#: includes/class-script-blocker.php:187
msgid "This content is blocked because it requires marketing cookies."
msgstr "Dette indhold er blokeret, fordi det kræver marketingcookies."

#: kansleri-cookie-consent.php:406
msgid ""
"This site uses a cookie consent banner powered by Kansleri Cookie Consent. "
"When you interact with the banner, a cookie named <code>kncc_consent</code> "
"is stored in your browser for up to 1 year. It records your consent "
"preferences (which cookie categories you accepted or rejected) so the site "
"can remember your choice on future visits. No personal data is stored in "
"this cookie."
msgstr ""
"Dette websted bruger et cookie-samtykkebanner fra Kansleri Cookie "
"Consent. Når du interagerer med banneret, gemmes en cookie med navnet "
"<code>kncc_consent</code> i din browser i op til 1 år. Den registrerer dine "
"samtykkeindstillinger (hvilke cookiekategorier du accepterede eller "
"afviste), så webstedet kan huske dit valg ved fremtidige besøg. Der gemmes "
"ingen personlige oplysninger i denne cookie."

#: includes/class-admin.php:71
msgid ""
"This will permanently delete all consent log records and statistics. "
"Continue?"
msgstr ""
"Dette sletter alle poster i samtykkelogen og al statistik permanent. Vil du "
"fortsætte?"

